{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"最后一阵激动又顶上来，随即退下，他先感到身体松开。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S12\", \"S13\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M26\", \"M31\", \"M35\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S12把他卷进忘我欢喜，S13又让疑问留在欢喜里；强度退下时，身体先松开。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S12\", \"S13\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M26\", \"M31\", \"M35\", \"M39\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"身体松开后，早先那种私密温柔又浮上来，却已像回望，不像重新开始。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\", \"S06\", \"S09\", \"S10\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M32\", \"M43\", \"M44\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S09让他知道回想不能复现那一刻，S10却让他仍能感激那个人。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S09\", \"S10\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M10\", \"M32\", \"M43\", \"M44\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"最后一点留恋短促地闪过，随即他清楚感到整段经历真的结束了。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S09\", \"S10\", \"S13\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M40\", \"M43\", \"M45\", \"M46\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S09让他不能把过去追回现在，S13也让他不能替对方作答；结尾只能结束而不作答。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S09\", \"S13\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M33\", \"M40\", \"M43\", \"M45\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他开始承认，整段经历可以在对方仍未作答时真正结束。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2ca74221-9b93-4aad-9179-15306ce16f33", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\g